{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_akun_pemohon_dan_approval_kkprl", "label": "Akun pemohon dan approval KKPRL", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L1", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_guard_pemohon_terpisah", "label": "Guard pemohon terpisah", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L11", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "KkprlApplicant/kkprl_applicant terpisah dari User/web/Sanctum; approval memakai approved_at, bukan User.status. Tanpa role, API token atau broker reset email; snapshot tidak memasukkan metadata akun/owner."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_registrasi_pending_tanpa_draft", "label": "Registrasi pending tanpa draft", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L7", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hanya email/password/konfirmasi; tidak membuat draft atau memanggil AI, input owner/role/approval tidak diterima; tiket dan HP kontak tetap ada."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_dokumen_generated_dan_builder_berbeda", "label": "Dokumen generated dan builder berbeda", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L31", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pending hanya mengunduh dokumen generated miliknya dengan pemeriksaan integritas; tidak menerima data/lampiran mentah maupun builder. Approved tetap tunduk owner, lock, quota dan revisi; ketentuan cutover masih acceptance, bukan bukti implementasi tahap 1."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_otorisasi_fresh_sebelum_persistence", "label": "Otorisasi fresh sebelum persistence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L43", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rencana setiap entry point mengambil akun fresh/owner/versi sesi; operasi lama memeriksa lagi sebelum penulisan dan row lock akun melindungi race dengan revocation/reset. Implementasi cutover bukan cakupan tahap 1."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_permission_admin_akun_terpisah", "label": "Permission admin akun terpisah", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L36", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ViewAny, View, Approve, ResetPassword, AssignOwner KkprlApplicant dipisah; role admin/pimpinan/super_admin saja menerima seeder. ApproveEdit:KkprlProposal tidak memberi approval akun."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_legacy_owner_terverifikasi_seluruh_revisi", "label": "Legacy owner terverifikasi seluruh revisi", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L52", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Petugas berpermission khusus memverifikasi manual, alasan dan referensi bukti; seluruh rantai atomik, owner berbeda ditolak. Tidak mencocokkan email/HP/tiket otomatis; payload/status/snapshot/updated_at tidak berubah."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_migrasi_additive_akun_dan_owner_nullable", "label": "Migrasi additive akun dan owner nullable", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L50", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tabel akun/audit baru dan FK applicant_id nullable; legacy tetap tanpa owner sampai assignment terverifikasi. Tanpa migrate:fresh, penghapusan riwayat atau pengubahan migration lama."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_cutover_tiket_hp_terencana", "label": "Cutover tiket HP terencana", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L54", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Endpoint lama akan menjadi login akun, grant verifier lama ditutup, sesi kkprl_proposal_access diabaikan. ADR-001 baru superseded setelah boundary akun berlaku; tahap 1 tidak mengklaim cutover selesai."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_password_baru_dimasukkan_petugas", "label": "Password baru dimasukkan petugas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L13", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reset oleh permission khusus hanya menarget tabel pemohon; hash tersimpan, versi sesi naik, remember token diganti. Penyampaian manual kanal privat organisasi; tanpa email/OTP/WhatsApp otomatis."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_audit_akun_append_only_tanpa_secret", "label": "Audit akun append only tanpa secret", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L45", "_origin": "semantic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actor/target/tindakan/waktu dicatat; alasan/referensi owner dienkripsi. Audit tidak merekam plaintext/hash password atau session token."}, {"id": "docs_kkprl_applicant_account_spec_acceptance_keamanan_akun_dan_regresi", "label": "Acceptance keamanan akun dan regresi", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kkprl-applicant-account-spec.md", "source_location": "L60",